# CurseForge's packager: the root is the Cabbie add-on, and the 17 map add-ons move out beside it.
package-as: Cabbie

manual-changelog: CHANGELOG.md

move-folders:
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Dungeons: Cabbie_Data_Dungeons
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK: Cabbie_Data_EK
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK_2: Cabbie_Data_EK_2
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK_3: Cabbie_Data_EK_3
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK_4: Cabbie_Data_EK_4
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_EK_5: Cabbie_Data_EK_5
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_2: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_2
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_3: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_3
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_4: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_4
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_5: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_5
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_6: Cabbie_Data_Kalimdor_6
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Data_Zephras: Cabbie_Data_Zephras
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_EK: Cabbie_Landmarks_EK
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_EK_2: Cabbie_Landmarks_EK_2
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor: Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor
  Cabbie/Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor_2: Cabbie_Landmarks_Kalimdor_2

ignore:
  - README.md
